{
  "analysis": "The clawd-variants.txt was truncated. I can see the basic structure: standard Clawd, Clawd with arms (using ╱ and ╲ for arms), Clawd with hat (using ┌─┐), and a large loading screen variant. I need to see more of the file and also read the anatomy and unicode blocks files for complete understanding.",
  "plan": "Read the rest of clawd-variants.txt using tail or less, and also read the clawd-anatomy.md and unicode-blocks.md files.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "tail -100 skill_context/assets/clawd-variants.txt\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat skill_context/references/clawd-anatomy.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
