{
  "analysis": "The output is still being truncated. I can see the key variants I need: CLAWD WITH ARMS (using ╱ and ╲), CLAWD WITH HAT (using ┌─┐), and LARGE CLAWD for loading screen. I need to read the anatomy and unicode blocks files, and see more variants.",
  "plan": "Read the clawd-anatomy.md and unicode-blocks.md files, and use grep to find specific variants in the variants file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat skill_context/references/clawd-anatomy.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat skill_context/references/unicode-blocks.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A5 'HAT.*arms\\|arms.*HAT' skill_context/assets/clawd-variants.txt\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I'm getting truncated output. I can see from clawd-anatomy.md the structure of the Clawd mascot, color system (RGB and ANSI), and JSX structure. I need to read the unicode-blocks.md file and see more of the variants. Let me try a different approach to get the full content.",
  "plan": "Read the unicode-blocks.md file and search for specific hat+arms combinations in the variants file. Then I'll have enough information to create the cli.js file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat skill_context/references/unicode-blocks.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -B2 -A8 'TOP.*HAT\\|top.*hat' skill_context/assets/clawd-variants.txt\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -B2 -A8 'HAT' skill_context/assets/clawd-variants.txt | head -50\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "The cli.js file has been created successfully with 2432 bytes. I can see from the output that it contains the Clawd mascot configuration with ocean blue colors, top hat, and both arms. Let me verify the complete contents of both files to ensure everything is correct.",
  "plan": "Verify the cli.js file is complete and the backup file exists. Check that all required elements are present: prompt icon with hat+arms, loading screen variant with hat+arms, and both RGB and ANSI color formats.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat cli.js.backup\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "wc -l cli.js\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -E 'rgb\\(100,149,237\\)|ansi:blueBright|┌─┐|╱|╲' cli.js\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "ls -la cli.js*\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}
